[ti:Silent Night]
[ar:Catharine Eastman]
[00:00.40]Silent night, holy night
[00:09.00]All is calm, all is bright
[00:18.00]Round yon Virgin, Mother and Child
[00:26.90]Holy Infant so tender and mild
[00:36.00]Sleep in heavenly peace
[00:44.90]Sleep in heavenly peace
[00:53.50]Silent night, holy night
[01:02.60]Shepherds quake at the sight
[01:11.30]Glories stream from heaven afar
[01:20.20]Heavenly hosts sing Alleluia
[01:29.00]Christ the Saviour is born
[01:38.20]Christ the Saviour is born
[01:47.80]Silent night, holy night
[01:56.90]Son of God, love's pure light
[02:06.10]Radiant beams from Thy holy face
[02:15.30]With the dawn of redeeming grace
[02:24.40]Jesus, Lord, at Thy birth
[02:33.60]Jesus, Lord, at Thy birth
